(Avataar Remote Work Policy) Tj T*
T*
(Version 2.1 - Effective 1 November 2026) Tj T*
T*
(1. Purpose) Tj T*
T*
(This policy explains how employees can work remotely while keeping teams) Tj T*
(productive and customer data secure. It applies to all full-time and) Tj T*
(part-time employees in India, the United States and Singapore.) Tj T*
T*
(2. Eligibility) Tj T*
T*
(Employees become eligible after completing 90 days of service. Managers) Tj T*
(may approve up to 3 remote days per week. Fully remote arrangements need) Tj T*
(written approval from both the department head and Human Resources.) Tj T*
