(3. Working Hours) Tj T*
T*
(Remote employees must be available during core hours, 11:00 to 16:00 IST,) Tj T*
(and respond to messages within 2 hours. Meetings should be scheduled within) Tj T*
(core hours whenever teams span more than one time zone.) Tj T*
T*
(4. Equipment and Allowance) Tj T*
T*
(The company provides a laptop, a headset and a one-time home office) Tj T*
(allowance of Rs 25,000. Employees may claim an internet reimbursement of) Tj T*
(up to Rs 1,500 per month by submitting receipts before the 5th of the) Tj T*
(following month. All equipment remains company property.) Tj T*
