(5. Security Requirements) Tj T*
T*
(Company devices must use full-disk encryption and the approved VPN at all) Tj T*
(times. Customer documents may not be printed or stored on personal devices.) Tj T*
(Public Wi-Fi may only be used with the VPN enabled. Lost or stolen devices) Tj T*
(must be reported to IT Security within 24 hours.) Tj T*
T*
(6. Performance and Review) Tj T*
T*
(Remote arrangements are reviewed every 6 months. Managers may end an) Tj T*
(arrangement with 14 days notice if performance or collaboration targets) Tj T*
(are not met. Employees may request a review at any time.) Tj T*
