(7. Health and Safety) Tj T*
T*
(Employees should set up a safe workspace with adequate lighting and an) Tj T*
(ergonomic chair. Work-related injuries at home must be reported within) Tj T*
(48 hours, in the same way as injuries in the office.) Tj T*
T*
(8. Contacts) Tj T*
T*
(Questions about this policy should be sent to hr-policy@avataar.example.) Tj T*
(Security incidents should be reported to security@avataar.example or by) Tj T*
(calling the 24-hour helpdesk at extension 4400.) Tj T*
